+# InHouse Wellness
+
+> InHouse Wellness ({{ agents.store_url }}) is a United States retailer of home saunas and cold plunges. It also publishes the Verified Sauna Database: specifications and electrical requirements for home sauna models, each value copied from the manufacturer's own product page or manual, with its source, a grade and the date it was read.
+
+## Verified Sauna Database
+
+- [Verified Sauna Database]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/sauna-database): one row per model with a verified page (brand, heat type, capacity, power supply), each linking to that model's page.
+- [How the Sauna Database Is Verified]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/sauna-database-methodology): where values come from, how they are graded, which models get a page and which do not, and how to report a correction.
+
+## How records are verified
+
+- Values come from the manufacturer's own product page (graded Listed) or the manufacturer's own manual or specification sheet (graded Documented).
+- Retailer pages are never used as evidence, including InHouse Wellness's own product pages.
+- Every value on a model page links its source and shows its grade and the date it was read.
+- When no source we could read states a single value, the page says "Not verified" instead of estimating one.
+- The same rules apply to every brand, including brands InHouse Wellness sells.
+- Corrections are made from the manufacturer's own sources; the methodology page explains how to send one.
+
+## For agents
